  "content": {
    "id": "p31-q30-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "30",
    "prompt": "Simplify the following.\n$$\\frac{2x^2+7x+3}{2x+1}$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$x+3$, $x\\ne-\\frac12$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{2x^2+7x+3}{2x+1}&=\\frac{(2x+1)(x+3)}{2x+1}\\\\\\frac{2x^2+7x+3}{2x+1}&=x+3.\\end{align*}$$\nThe original denominator requires $x\\ne-\\frac12$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
